{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><figure><img src=\"https://cdn3.am730.com.hk/processed/2026-11/1061857/block/singleImage/3257022/df/01M6GS1G0KJBZ0PKKBWKW0EC1F.jpg?updatedAt=1793712222\"/><figcaption>海關在女子的行李內檢獲66隻活雀鳥。</figcaption></figure><p>海關今日(3日)在落馬洲支線管制站檢獲66隻懷疑非法進口活雀鳥，估計市值約3,000元。一名34歲內地女子被捕。</p><p>海關人員今日在上述管制站入境大堂截查一名34歲抵港內地女旅客，經檢查後，在其個人行李內檢獲該批裝載於鳥籠的懷疑非法進口活雀鳥。該名女子隨即被捕。案件已轉交漁農自然護理署跟進。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-03T14:41:30.277100+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":163,"images":1,"source":"am730","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-03T13:23:42+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-03T21:38:22.118887+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-03T14:38:31.056429+00:00","content_hash":"2e412a8c1716a88103295e92b29cd528f63b702bb8e78e153a5f851155dc1b0e","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-03T14:41:30.277100+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}